 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "具体到每个角色，今天就能做的一件事。",
   "spoken": "具体到每个决色，今天就能做的一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg6-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.648,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.412
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "写电路的人，给每条约束，写一个恶意输入的测试。",
   "spoken": "写电路的人，给每条约束，写一个恶意输入的测试。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg6-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.468,
   "dur": 4.752,
   "speechStart": 5.566,
   "speechEnd": 9.375
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "写结算合约的人，列出证明里的每个公开输入，看有没有字段只被读取，没有被证明。",
   "spoken": "写结算合约的人，列出证明里的每个公开输入，看有没有字段只被读取，没有被证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg6-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.44,
   "dur": 7.392,
   "speechStart": 10.538,
   "speechEnd": 17.014
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "运营 L2 或桥的人，验证器和电路的升级要走时间锁，紧急权限要公开。",
   "spoken": "运营 L2 或桥的人，验证器和电路的升级要走时间锁，紧急权限要公开。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg6-03.mp3",
   "start": 18.052,
   "dur": 6.768,
   "speechStart": 18.15,
   "speechEnd": 23.983
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "普通用户，在 L2 上放大额资产前，先在 L2BEAT 上查它的 Stage。协议宣布弃用，及时取回资产。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，在 L2 上放大额资产前，先在 L2BEAT 上查它的 Stage。协议宣布弃用，及时取回资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg6-04.mp3",
   "start": 25.04,
   "dur": 9.24,
   "speechStart": 25.138,
   "speechEnd": 33.445
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "使用隐私或 ZK 协议前，确认它有公开的电路审计和赏金计划。",
   "spoken": "使用隐私或 ZK 协议前，确认它有公开的电路审计和赏金计划。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg6-05.mp3",
   "start": 34.5,
   "dur": 6.072,
   "speechStart": 34.598,
   "speechEnd": 39.74
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。只修验证器合约，能堵住这个洞吗？",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。只修验证器合约，能堵住这个洞吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg6-06.mp3",
   "start": 40.792,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 40.89,
   "speechEnd": 45.494
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "不能。验证器确认的，是证明对这些公开输入成立。",
   "spoken": "不能。验证器确认的，是证明对这些公开输入成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg6-07.mp3",
   "start": 46.812,
   "dur": 5.424,
   "speechStart": 46.91,
   "speechEnd": 51.383
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "漏洞在业务合约。结算几笔交易的边界，没有和证明绑定。",
   "spoken": "漏洞在业务合约。结算几笔交易的边界，没有和证明绑定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg6-08.mp3",
   "start": 52.456,
   "dur": 5.736,
   "speechStart": 52.554,
   "speechEnd": 57.337
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "这个答案的前提，是电路、设置和验证器都没有出错。任何一环出错，有效的证明也会说谎。",
   "spoken": "这个答案的前提，是电路、设置和验证器都没有出错。任何一环出错，有效的证明也会说谎。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg6-09.mp3",
   "start": 58.412,
   "dur": 8.664,
   "speechStart": 58.51,
   "speechEnd": 66.233
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "证明对了，不等于电路对了，也不等于钱算对了。",
   "spoken": "证明对了，不等于电路对了，也不等于钱算对了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg6-10.mp3",
   "start": 67.296,
